        {
          "text": "With a groan, she extricated herself from the bedsheets and climbed to her feet",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 955
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Called away by Queen Éalodyne. I’ll return as soon as I can",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1175
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Where Silas embodied the dark, complex, and impassioned essence of Foundation, Adrien was the sun",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4896
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A smaller, more insidious voice in her head whispered that he was only here because of her, and the best thing she could",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6225
        }
      ],
      "words": 33
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“After last night, I think I’ve at least earned a twenty-four-hour moratorium on your ire,” he growled",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7300
        }
      ],
      "words": 17
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Watching you both",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8982
        },
        {
          "text": "it’s like the Library itself is pushing you toward each other to heal the wounds going back centuries",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9000
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "In my darkest moments, when I needed the light, you were my dawn",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9543
        }
      ],
      "words": 13
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A year ago, I thought this was a zero-sum game where, if he wins, then I must necessarily lose",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10317
        },
        {
          "text": "I won’t be the one to make you suffer for it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10619
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“You do.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13166
        }
      ],
      "words": 2
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Unwrite it.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13595
        }
      ],
      "words": 2
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You are not an unaccounted-for variable that has thrown this story out of balance. Our love is as interwoven as whatever",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14311
        },
        {
          "text": "were I to let you go, I think it would be the end of me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14637
        }
      ],
      "words": 64
    }
  ],
